colspan="1">Strongly disagree or disagree</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">The rationale for developing a guideline, as stated in the &#x0201c;Introduction&#x0201d; section of the report, is clear.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7 (100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">There is a need for a guideline on this topic.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 (85.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1 (14.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">The literature search is relevant and complete.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7 (100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">The results of the trials described in the report are interpreted according to my understanding of the data.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7 (100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">The draft recommendations in the report are clear.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7 (100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">I agree with the draft recommendations as stated.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7 (100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">This report should be approved as a practice guideline.</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 (85.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1 (14.3)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Very likely or likely</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Unsure</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Not at all likely or unlikely</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">If this report were to become a practice guideline, how likely would you be to make use of it in your own practice?</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 (85.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1 (14.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>